      "description": "For the questions you keep to yourself.\n\nAskZine is a quiet ritual for curiosity and reflection, designed around the unfolding experience of iPhone Duo.\n\nOn iPhone Duo, close your phone with a question in mind. Open it when you're ready. As the screen unfolds, an answer gradually appears. On other supported iPhones and iPads, tap to reveal.\n\nYou choose the moment. You set the pace.\n\nSometimes, a few words help you see things differently. Your answer stays the same until you choose New question.\n\nYour question stays in your mind. No typing. No recording. No account. Answers come from a collection stored on your device and are available offline.\n\nSave an answer as a photo, video, or Live Photo. Keep it for yourself, or share it when you choose.\n\nOne purchase. No subscription.\n\nYour question. Your AskZine.",
